    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d340">

                <pb facs="0331" n="319" sameAs="frus:frus1941v01/pg319"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011 European War 1939/12503: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Hungary</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Pell</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Budapest</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1941-06-27T10:00:00+02:00">June 27, 1941—10
                            a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received June 27—7:37 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>391. Hungary this morning declared that because of Russian air raids on Kassa and
                    attempt on Budapest yesterday Hungary is now in a state of war with Soviet
                    Russia.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Pell</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
